# DrowseSense AI 🚗💤

DrowseSense AI is a real-time Driver Drowsiness Detection System built using Deep Learning and Computer Vision.  
The project uses a Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) to classify whether a driver is **Awake** or **Drowsy** using webcam input.

The main objective of this project is to improve road safety by detecting signs of fatigue and alerting drivers before accidents occur.

