# 📌 Problem Statement

Driver fatigue and drowsiness are major causes of road accidents worldwide.  
Traditional monitoring systems are expensive and require specialized hardware.

DrowseSense AI provides a lightweight AI-based solution capable of detecting drowsiness using only a webcam and a trained deep learning model.

